    "content": "$\\cot x = 0.5$",
    "rationale": "Cotangent takes every real value: $\\tan x = 2$ has solutions."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "$\\sec x = \\frac{1}{\\cos x}$ and $-1 \\leq \\cos x \\leq 1$, so $\\sec x \\geq 1$ or $\\sec x \\leq -1$. A value such as 0.5 is impossible and must be rejected when it comes out of a quadratic.",
